00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:06,915
MIHAI: Țineți ușa! Etajul 9, vă rog! Șefa mă omoară dacă se răcește cafeaua!

2
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:08,415
LEANA: Ține-te bine.

3
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,618
MIHAI: Ăsta nu e etajul 9.

4
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:15,008
LEANA: Nu. E 3.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,502
MIHAI: Pisică! Pisică! PISICĂ!

6
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:22,120
LEANA: 7.

7
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:27,417
MIHAI: Cafeaua! Cafeaua plutește!

8
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:29,944
LEANA: 13.

9
00:00:30,450 --> 00:00:31,280
LEANA: 5.

10
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:32,572
LEANA: -2.

11
00:00:32,650 --> 00:00:33,480
LEANA: 8.

12
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:35,787
LEANA: 9.

13
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,380
MIHAI: ...Ăștia suntem noi.

14
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:44,352
LEANA: Etajul 9 e liftul. Și eu sunt șefa.

15
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:46,132
